# FreeCell #1 won through the mouse: the solution's moves as drags (to the
# columns and the free cells) and double clicks (home); the win's cards
# bouncing; a click stops them and the win box shows
game 2 1
shot fcdrag
moves test/freecell1.moves
state
wait 240
shotnow winanim
wait 60
click 320 300
wait 90
end 30
